% 32^3 Sedov blast in a periodic box falling under a uniform g = -0.5 (GRAVITY_TESTPROBLEM_RT)
InitCondFile                       wakeup_falling_box_ics
OutputDir                          output
TimeMax                            0.03
BoxSize                            6
TimeBetSnapshot                    0.007    % not a divisor of TimeMax: a regular output at TimeMax would precede the last half-kick and suppress the synchronised final one
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.1
MaxMemSize                         5000
UnitLength_in_cm                   3.085678e+21
UnitMass_in_g                      1.989e+43
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s           100000
MinGasTemp                         10
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.002
CourantFac                         0.05
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.1
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.0015
TimeBetStatistics                  0.001
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.01
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
TreeDomainUpdateFrequency          0.5
